You are an AI coding assistant working on SpacetimeCRM.

## Stack
FastAPI (Python) + React 19 + Vite 8 + Supabase + SpacetimeDB

## Build & Test
- Build: `cd web && npm run build`
- Test: `cd web && npm test && cd ../server && python -m pytest`
- Lint: check for warnings before committing

## Conventions
- Supabase for auth + database (project ref in .env)
- IPv6-only Supabase — use pooler for connections
- STDB for kanban data

## Ports
- 5185 Vite dev server
- 3001 SpacetimeDB

## Documentation
- AGENTS.md — full agent onboarding
- CLAUDE.md — Claude Code quickstart
- Makefile — build/test/lint targets (`make help`)
